    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1563">

                <pb facs="1259" n="1143" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1143"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 819.00/399.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of Panama to the Acting Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 20.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of Panama</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-05-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 16, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your excellency’s note of May 13, in which you inform me [etc.]</p>
                <p>Immediately upon receipt of that communication I telegraphed the substance of it
                    to my Government, which will doubtless fully appreciate this additional proof of
                    the solicitude of your excellency’s Government for the orderly and
                    constitutional development of the Government of the Republic.</p>
                <p>I beg your excellency to express to the President my sincere thanks for having
                    favorably considered the desires of my Government, for which I am also grateful
                    to your excellency.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ricardo Arias.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
